{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_136_title", "source_sha256": "d6c1b813a432831f10165d97da6e36a4a57871ef0b92debf0d3e7acdff2d50d9", "ja": "君が見ていてくれたから", "zh": "因为有你注视着我", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_136_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e76c649997ab93ab2ddb4eeec8a45dbce93d57dfdd2ce8c573e4ad020cfd74d5", "ja": "亜美の新曲は、なんと恋の歌。まだ恋心に\nピンと来ない亜美だが、そんな折、クラスの\n男子に告白される。仲間やプロデューサーの\n言葉を経て彼と向き合い、亜美は少しだけ、\n誰かを想うという気持ちを知るのだった。", "zh": "亚美的新曲竟然是一首情歌。面对恋心\n还完全没有实感的亚美，却在这时被同班的\n男生告白了。经历同伴与制作人的\n指引后，她直面了对方，也稍微体会到了\n思慕一个人的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_136_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6b924a6b2684687e35644442df8d1e405c7016935ac49ed3123f5ad6dd8209ef", "ja": "（亜美の新曲お披露目公演が終わった。\n拍手は、初め静かに、やがて大きく広がっていく……）", "zh": "（亚美的新歌首场演出结束了。掌声起初很轻，随后渐渐扩散开来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_136_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "b2a29d4ac1cff251a564f12582df8c22dbacdc79e1417f83611047ec680600bf", "ja": "お疲れさまだヨー、アミ！\nすごいネ、お客さんの拍手。まだ鳴りやまないヨ！", "zh": "辛苦了，亚美！  \n观众的掌声真厉害。到现在还没停呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_136_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "328bbfacde3311b031684fab844cbf2069c6a1733d83e9e999ab2141d1955caa", "ja": "それくらい、いいステージだったってことですよね。\n……ちょっと、悔しいくらい。", "zh": "也就是说，刚才的舞台非常精彩呢。\n……精彩到让我都有点不甘心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_136_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "702f8927cf5bec605e2458dfd750753c6135f79587bad99471b9385500e833fd", "ja": "うん。\n亜美ちゃん、とっても素敵だったよ……！", "zh": "嗯。\n亚美，表现得真的很棒哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_136_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "df5d1be0f387793a7662e60564008c38a097590ea487e8398817f7a48dc6d50f", "ja": "今日のステージは、亜美だけのチカラじゃないかんね。\nみんなが亜美を支えててくれたから、できたんだよ！", "zh": "今天的舞台，可不是靠亚美一个人的力量哦。\n因为有大家一直支持着亚美，才能做到的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_136_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "98a2987e2bf9ecdfe191c202c29643b3cdab8c28b8a8495ee2436af2bc9907f0", "ja": "あら、ずいぶん殊勝なこと言うのね。\nなんだか別人みたい♪", "zh": "哎呀，居然说出这么谦逊的话来。简直像变了个人一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_136_1006_p", "source_sha256": "80a2352eb29154b5c46f19fbde8f2443d1fb2aa98dac53be4b5d90e2c123cf91", "ja": "亜美！　みんなも、お疲れさま。", "zh": "亚美！大家也辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_136_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "39006c1f2e95ade2e44a0c7d8ccec5e11c98bbedac93ad01d59fc9e240df530e", "ja": "兄ちゃん、どうだった！？　いつもと違う\n大人っぽい亜美に、メロメロだったっしょ～？", "zh": "哥哥，感觉怎么样！？是不是已经被和平时不一样、成熟了不少的亚美迷得神魂颠倒啦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_136_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "1a7c581e34a39b012d340e10eae486222a959878ba27d80632e3b6a660539c7a", "ja": "……やっぱり、訂正するわ。\nいつもの亜美そのものね！", "zh": "……我还是改口吧。\n果然就是平时的亚美嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_136_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "05b54e14ec1424d0306b94393707adeed5426f88ba13f60d9074cfa41574ec86", "ja": "ふふっ。でも、パフォーマンスは本当に凄かったし。\nそこは認めざるを得ないですね！", "zh": "呵呵。不过，她的表现确实很厉害。\n这一点不得不承认！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_136_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_136_1010_audience", "source_sha256": "f0505579cb5f3b2480ff0a0479309ebf5f27f5f64584b1961ceb624575ad5934", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！", "zh": "安可！安可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
